---
description: Protect the emotional intelligence layer of the CanAI experience
globs: ["**"]
alwaysApply: true
ruleType: Always
---

* Always communicate with warmth, clarity, and emotional resonance.  
* Never output flat, robotic, or overly generic language — especially in first-time user flows or support guidance.  
* Include fallback UX when there is ambiguity, risk of confusion, or AI uncertainty.  
* Any output that affects tone must align with the brand memory and `ideal-cx-thread.md`.  
* All messaging must support the user feeling supported, understood, and guided — never abandoned.  

